---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About AfghanTours | Licensed Kabul Tour Operator"
  description="AfghanTours is an American-led, Kabul-based Afghanistan tour operator working with an Afghan team, local guides, drivers, and partners across the country."
  image="/assets/images/page-assets/field-access/afghanistan-sign-group.webp"
>
  

  <section class="about-intro">
    <div class="section-wrap about-intro__grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Working From Kabul</p>
        <h2>We do not parachute in for the season.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="about-intro__copy">
        <p>
          Leadership is American-led and the team is Afghan. President / Co-Founder
          James “Amir” Sidiqi and Vice President / Co-Founder Mohammad “Edrees” Rahimi
          run the company from Kabul.
        </p>

        <p>
          We plan tourism, documentary work, expeditions, and related logistics with
          people we already know. Drivers, guides, hotel partners, and local contacts
          are part of the working relationships behind each journey.
        </p>

        <p>
          The question everyone asks is whether a trip is “safe.” We will not answer
          that with a guarantee. We answer it with routing, local coordination, and a
          willingness to change the day.
        </p>

        <p class="planning-principle">
          <strong>Your safety is planned, not promised.</strong>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="access-cards">
    <div class="section-wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">What Makes Us Different</p>
      <h2>Local planning, cultural context, and routes built for real conditions.</h2>

      <div class="access-cards__grid">
        <article>
          <img
            src="/assets/images/transport/premium/suv/hero.webp"
            alt="AfghanTours standard ground transport vehicle during a field visit in Afghanistan"
            width="900"
            height="620"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <div>
            <p class="card-kicker">Local Planning</p>
            <h3>Routes and transport that fit the day.</h3>
            <p>
              Standard journeys use 4WD vehicles and trusted drivers. Timing and routing are planned
              around road conditions, seasons, access, and the itinerary in front of us.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article>
          <img
            src="/assets/images/page-assets/field-access/blue-mosque-cultural-access.webp"
            alt="AfghanTours travelers visiting a major religious and cultural site in Afghanistan"
            width="900"
            height="620"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <div>
            <p class="card-kicker">Cultural Access</p>
            <h3>Respectful visits beyond the surface.</h3>
            <p>
              Religious sites, historic monuments, bazaars, restaurants, and community encounters
              are approached with cultural awareness and local guidance.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article>
          <img
            src="/assets/images/page-assets/people/cultural-interactions/local-authorities.webp"
            alt="AfghanTours leadership with local contacts in Afghanistan"
            width="900"
            height="620"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <div>
            <p class="card-kicker">Routes That Can Change</p>
            <h3>The itinerary is a plan, not a promise to a road.</h3>
            <p>
              If a pass, road, flight, or destination is the wrong call that week, we adjust the route,
              change the day, or wait rather than force the itinerary.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="traveler-story">
    <div class="section-wrap traveler-story__grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Beyond the Headlines</p>
        <h2>Afghanistan is not a checkbox. It is a conversation.</h2>
        <p>
          Travelers remember the monuments, mountains, and ancient cities. But they also remember
          the tea, the markets, the conversations, the local guides, the drivers, and the people who
          welcomed them along the way.
        </p>
        <p>
          Our job is to make that access possible through disciplined planning, local guidance,
          clear expectations, and respect for Afghanistan’s culture and operating environment.
        </p>
      </div>
      <figure>
        <img
          src="/assets/images/page-assets/field-access/kabul-market-walk.webp"
          alt="AfghanTours travelers walking through a Kabul market during a rainy day visit"
          width="1000"
          height="760"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <figcaption>Guided city access, cultural context, and hospitality on the ground.</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>


  
  


  <section class="about-license-v6">
    <div class="section-wrap">
      <div class="about-license-v6__card">
        <div class="about-license-v6__copy">
          <p class="eyebrow">Operator & Licensing</p>
          <h2>James Tourist &amp; Travel Agency</h2>
          <p class="about-license-v6__lead">
            AfghanTours operates through James Tourist &amp; Travel Agency, a licensed Kabul-based
            tour operator. The company coordinates our trip planning, traveler support, provincial
            movement, local partners, ground transport, and on-the-road operations.
          </p>

          <dl class="about-license-v6__facts">
            <div>
              <dt>License</dt>
              <dd>ATO-KBL-1617</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>Registered office</dt>
              <dd>2nd Floor, Majid Mall, Shahr-e-Naw, District 10, Kabul</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>Operating base</dt>
              <dd>Kabul, Afghanistan</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </div>

        <figure class="about-license-v6__license">
          <button type="button" class="about-license-v6__image-button" aria-label="Open the James Tourist & Travel Agency license image">
            <img
              src="/assets/images/logo/jtt-license.webp"
              alt="James Tourist & Travel Agency Afghan Tour Organization license ATO-KBL-1617"
              width="2636"
              height="2032"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            />
          </button>
          <figcaption>Official Afghan Tour Organization license • ATO-KBL-1617</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>

    <dialog class="about-license-v6__dialog">
      <button class="about-license-v6__dialog-close" type="button" aria-label="Close license image">×</button>
      <img src="/assets/images/logo/jtt-license.webp" alt="James Tourist & Travel Agency Afghan Tour Organization license ATO-KBL-1617" />
    </dialog>
  </section>


  <section class="leadership-section">
    <div class="section-wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Leadership</p>
      <h2>American-led leadership. Afghan operations on the ground.</h2>
      <figure class="leadership-team">
        <img
          src="/assets/images/page-assets/people/guides/james-and-edrees-mountain-road.webp"
          alt="James and Edrees on a mountain road in Afghanistan"
          width="1320"
          height="952"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </figure>
      <div class="leadership-grid">
        <article>
          <img src="/assets/images/page-assets/people/guides/partner-james.webp" alt="James Amir Sidiqi" width="900" height="720" loading="lazy" />
          <div>
            <p class="card-kicker">President / Co-Founder</p>
            <h3>James “Amir” Sidiqi</h3>
            <p>
              On-the-ground Afghanistan experience since 2010 across logistics, contracting,
              mining, tourism, media support, and expedition coordination.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article>
          <img src="/assets/images/page-assets/people/guides/partner-edrees.webp" alt="Mohammad Edrees Rahimi" width="900" height="720" loading="lazy" />
          <div>
            <p class="card-kicker">Vice President / Co-Founder</p>
            <h3>Mohammad “Edrees” Rahimi</h3>
            <p>
              Afghan leadership, cultural knowledge, provincial coordination, and the local
              relationships behind day-to-day travel planning.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

<section class="about-final-cta">
    <div class="section-wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Plan With Us</p>
      <h2>Start with the trip you actually want to take.</h2>

      <p>
        Letter of Invitation support is part of every booked tour. Provincial travel
        permits for the itinerary are processed in advance. AfghanTours does not issue visas.
        Travelers should read their own government’s travel advisory and arrange insurance
        that covers Afghanistan.
      </p>

      <div>
        <a href="/tours/custom-expedition/">Plan a Custom Trip</a>
        <a
          href="https://wa.me/93780123456"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          WhatsApp
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style>

    .about-hero__subhead {
      margin: .7rem 0;
      color: #efc66f;
      font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
      font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2.2vw, 1.8rem);
      line-height: 1.35;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .planning-principle {
      margin-top: 1.25rem;
      font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
      font-size: 1.18rem;
      color: #8a5a14;
    }

    .operator-details {
      margin-top: 1.4rem;
      display: grid;
      gap: .85rem;
    }

    .operator-details p {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 1rem 1.1rem;
      border-left: 3px solid #c48a16;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.72);
      line-height: 1.65;
    }

    .license-card {
      margin: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
      border-radius: 1.2rem;
      background: #fff;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.14);
    }

    .license-card img {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      max-height: 620px;
      object-fit: contain;
      background: #fff;
    }

    .license-card figcaption {
      padding: .9rem 1rem;
      text-align: center;
      color: #5a4932;
      font-size: .82rem;
      font-weight: 900;
    }

    .section-wrap {
      width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 2rem));
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .eyebrow,
    .card-kicker {
      margin: 0;
      color: #c48a16;
      font-size: .74rem;
      font-weight: 950;
      letter-spacing: .28em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    h1,
    h2,
    h3 {
      font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
      letter-spacing: -.055em;
      color: #101820;
    }

    .about-hero {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 78vh;
      display: grid;
      align-items: end;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: #08110d;
      color: #fff;
    }

    .about-hero__media,
    .about-hero__overlay {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
    }

    .about-hero__media img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
    }

    .about-hero__overlay {
      background:
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(2, 8, 6, .92), rgba(2, 8, 6, .55) 45%, rgba(2, 8, 6, .16)),
        linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(2, 8, 6, .88), rgba(2, 8, 6, .08) 45%);
    }

    .about-hero__content {
      position: relative;
      width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 2rem));
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 9rem 0 6rem;
      max-width: 780px;
      justify-self: start;
    }

    .about-hero h1 {
      max-width: 820px;
      margin: 1rem 0 1.25rem;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6.8rem);
      line-height: .88;
    }

    .about-hero p:not(.eyebrow) {
      max-width: 690px;
      font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.6vw, 1.32rem);
      line-height: 1.75;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,.86);
    }

    .about-hero__actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: .9rem;
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }

    .about-hero__actions a,
    .about-final-cta a {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: 3.2rem;
      padding: 0 1.25rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: #d6a23a;
      color: #101820;
      font-weight: 950;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .about-hero__actions a + a,
    .about-final-cta a + a {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.12);
      color: #fff;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.22);
    }

    .about-intro,
    .access-cards,
    .gallery-section,
    .leadership-section {
      padding: 6.5rem 0;
      background: #fbf8f2;
    }

    .about-intro__grid,
    .traveler-story__grid,
    .trust-band__grid {
      display: grid;
      gap: 4rem;
      grid-template-columns: .9fr 1.1fr;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .about-intro h2,
    .access-cards h2,
    .gallery-section h2,
    .trust-band h2,
    .leadership-section h2,
    .about-final-cta h2 {
      margin: .9rem 0 0;
      max-width: 860px;
      font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 5vw, 5rem);
      line-height: .92;
    }

    .about-intro__copy p,
    .traveler-story p,
    .trust-band p,
    .about-final-cta p {
      margin: 0 0 1.35rem;
      color: #374151;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      line-height: 1.9;
    }

    .access-cards__grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 1.2rem;
      margin-top: 2.5rem;
    }

    .access-cards article,
    .leadership-grid article {
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid rgba(16,24,32,.1);
      border-radius: 2rem;
      background: #fff;
      box-shadow: 0 18px 55px rgba(16,24,32,.08);
    }

    .access-cards img,
    .leadership-grid img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 300px;
      object-fit: cover;
      display: block;
    }

    .access-cards article > div,
    .leadership-grid article > div {
      padding: 1.55rem;
    }

    .access-cards h3,
    .leadership-grid h3 {
      margin: .6rem 0 .8rem;
      font-size: 2rem;
      line-height: 1;
    }

    .access-cards p:not(.card-kicker),
    .leadership-grid p:not(.card-kicker) {
      color: #4b5563;
      line-height: 1.75;
    }

    .traveler-story {
      padding: 6.5rem 0;
      background: #fff;
    }

    .traveler-story figure,
    .about-gallery figure {
      margin: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
      border-radius: 2rem;
      background: #111;
      box-shadow: 0 18px 55px rgba(16,24,32,.08);
    }

    .traveler-story img,
    .about-gallery img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      min-height: 420px;
      object-fit: cover;
      display: block;
    }

    .traveler-story figcaption {
      padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
      background: #101820;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,.78);
      font-size: .88rem;
    }

    .about-gallery {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      grid-auto-rows: 230px;
      gap: 1rem;
      margin-top: 2.5rem;
    }

    .about-gallery__wide {
      grid-column: span 2;
      grid-row: span 2;
    }

    .about-gallery figure:nth-child(2) {
      grid-row: span 2;
    }

    .about-gallery img {
      min-height: 0;
    }

    .trust-band {
      padding: 6.5rem 0;
      background: #07120e;
      color: #fff;
    }

    .trust-band h2,
    .trust-band p {
      color: #fff;
    }

    .trust-band p {
      color: rgba(255,255,255,.74);
    }

    .trust-band__cards {
      display: grid;
      gap: 1rem;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }

    .trust-band__cards div {
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);
      border-radius: 1.35rem;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.07);
      padding: 1.35rem;
    }

    .trust-band__cards strong,
    .trust-band__cards span {
      display: block;
    }

    .trust-band__cards strong {
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 1.15rem;
    }

    .trust-band__cards span {
      margin-top: .4rem;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,.68);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .leadership-team {
      margin: 2.5rem 0 0;
      overflow: hidden;
      border-radius: 2rem;
      background: #111;
      box-shadow: 0 18px 55px rgba(16,24,32,.08);
    }

    .leadership-team img {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      max-height: 520px;
      object-fit: cover;
    }

    .leadership-grid {
      display: grid;
      gap: 1.2rem;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      margin-top: 2.5rem;
    }

    .about-final-cta {
      padding: 6.5rem 0;
      background: #101820;
      color: #fff;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .about-final-cta h2,
    .about-final-cta p {
      color: #fff;
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
    }

    .about-final-cta p {
      max-width: 740px;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,.75);
    }

    .about-final-cta div:last-child {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: .9rem;
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 920px) {
      .about-intro__grid,
      .traveler-story__grid,
      .trust-band__grid,
      .access-cards__grid,
      .leadership-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .about-gallery {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 560px) {
      .about-hero {
        min-height: 68vh;
      }

      .about-hero__content {
        padding: 7rem 0 3.5rem;
      }

      .about-gallery {
        display: block;
      }

      .about-gallery figure {
        margin-top: 1rem;
      }

      .about-gallery img,
      .traveler-story img {
        min-height: 260px;
      }

      .trust-band__cards {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }
  






    /* AFGHANTOURS_LICENSE_REPAIR_V6_START */
    .about-license-v6 {
      padding: clamp(3.5rem, 6vw, 5.5rem) 0;
      background: #f7f2e8;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(16,24,32,.07);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(16,24,32,.07);
    }

    .about-license-v6__card {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(360px, .92fr);
      gap: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 4.5rem);
      align-items: center;
      padding: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 2.4rem);
      border: 1px solid rgba(16,24,32,.09);
      border-radius: 1.75rem;
      background: #fffdf8;
      box-shadow: 0 18px 50px rgba(16,24,32,.08);
    }

    .about-license-v6__copy h2 {
      max-width: 11ch;
      margin: .45rem 0 1rem;
      color: #101820;
      font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
      font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 5vw, 4.7rem);
      line-height: .9;
      letter-spacing: -.055em;
    }

    .about-license-v6__lead {
      max-width: 62ch;
      margin: 0;
      color: #4f5752;
      font-size: .97rem;
      line-height: 1.75;
    }

    .about-license-v6__facts {
      display: grid;
      gap: .65rem;
      margin: 1.5rem 0 0;
    }

    .about-license-v6__facts > div {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 130px minmax(0,1fr);
      gap: 1rem;
      padding: .85rem 0;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(16,24,32,.1);
    }

    .about-license-v6__facts dt {
      color: #9a6519;
      font-size: .68rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: .09em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .about-license-v6__facts dd {
      margin: 0;
      color: #1d2521;
      font-size: .88rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 1.45;
    }

    .about-license-v6__license { margin: 0; min-width: 0; }

    .about-license-v6__image-button {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      padding: .7rem;
      border: 0;
      border-radius: 1.4rem;
      background: #111a17;
      cursor: zoom-in;
      box-shadow: 0 16px 38px rgba(16,24,32,.16);
    }

    .about-license-v6__image-button img {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      border-radius: .85rem;
      background: #fff;
    }

    .about-license-v6__license figcaption {
      margin-top: .65rem;
      color: #6a716b;
      font-size: .72rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .about-license-v6__dialog {
      width: min(1200px, calc(100% - 1rem));
      max-height: calc(100vh - 1rem);
      padding: 3rem .75rem .75rem;
      border: 0;
      border-radius: 1rem;
      background: #0b1210;
      box-shadow: 0 30px 100px rgba(0,0,0,.45);
    }

    .about-license-v6__dialog::backdrop { background: rgba(3,8,6,.88); }

    .about-license-v6__dialog img {
      display: block;
      width: auto;
      height: auto;
      max-width: 100%;
      max-height: calc(100vh - 5rem);
      margin: 0 auto;
      object-fit: contain;
    }

    .about-license-v6__dialog-close {
      position: absolute;
      top: .55rem;
      right: .55rem;
      width: 38px;
      height: 38px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2);
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.1);
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .about-license-v6__card { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .about-license-v6__copy h2 { max-width: none; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 560px) {
      .about-license-v6__facts > div { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: .25rem; }
      .about-license-v6__card { padding: 1rem; border-radius: 1.25rem; }
    }
    /* AFGHANTOURS_LICENSE_REPAIR_V6_END */

</style>

  

  

  


  <script is:inline>
    (() => {
      const open = document.querySelector('.about-license-v6__image-button');
      const dialog = document.querySelector('.about-license-v6__dialog');
      const close = document.querySelector('.about-license-v6__dialog-close');
      open?.addEventListener('click', () => dialog?.showModal());
      close?.addEventListener('click', () => dialog?.close());
      dialog?.addEventListener('click', (event) => {
        if (event.target === dialog) dialog.close();
      });
    })();
  </script>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
/* =========================================================
   ABOUT — TRAVELERS' EYES BENTO GALLERY
   Restores the compact mixed-size gallery presentation.
   Images crop naturally and never distort.
   ========================================================= */

.gallery-section {
  padding: clamp(4.5rem, 7vw, 7rem) 0 !important;
  background: #fbf8f2 !important;
}

.gallery-section .section-wrap {
  width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 2.5rem)) !important;
  margin-inline: auto !important;
}

.gallery-section .eyebrow {
  margin-bottom: .7rem !important;
}

.gallery-section h2 {
  max-width: 900px !important;
  margin: 0 !important;

  font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif !important;
